Package: voice-bridge
Version: 0.5.6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Voice Bridge
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, python3-dev, build-essential, linux-libc-dev, wl-clipboard, xclip, libportaudio2, acl, libegl1, libgl1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xinerama0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1
Description: Local dictation desktop with Qwen3-ASR and model manager
 Voice Bridge separates its desktop interface from a headless dictation engine,
 provides native uinput delivery on Wayland, and includes a real paste-field test.
 Install/upgrade runtime and per-user input access using the bundled install.sh.
